    "description": "Mixed Brands\nSmoking Pipe Collection with Carousel Rack and Humidor Jar\nVintage, Mixed Materials including Briar, Metal, and Glass\nThis comprehensive tobacco enthusiast's lot includes seven varied smoking pipes and a classic wooden carousel-style storage rack. The collection showcases a diverse range of pipe-making traditions, from the industrial aesthetic of the metal-stemmed Viking pipe to rustic, hand-carved artisan pieces and a highly detailed figural bowl featuring a carved bearded head. The centerpiece is a tiered wooden carousel that holds up to 12 pipes and features a central glass humidor jar for tobacco preservation.\nViking Metal Stem Pipe: Features a chrome-finished cooling stem and a removable bowl for cleaning\nFigural Carved Pipe: Intricately detailed bowl depicting a bearded man, likely meerschaum or high-density composite\nHand-Carved Artisan Pipes: Two rustic faceted wood pipes, one bearing the hand-carved initials \"RKB\" on the underside\nWooden Carousel Rack: Two-tier walnut-toned wood construction with a ribbed glass humidor jar and matching wooden lid\nDimensions: Carousel rack measures approximately 7\" in diameter and 6.5\" in height to the lid top\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition overall. All pipes show evidence of previous use with carbon buildup inside the bowls and light tooth chatter or oxidation on some stems. The wooden carousel shows minor surface scuffing and finish wear consistent with age. The glass humidor jar is free of chips or cracks. The Viking metal stem shows light surface pitting typical of vintage chrome-plated components.",
